00:13:06.552 --> 00:13:08.387
that he did during Vietnam.

00:13:08.387 --> 00:13:11.357
And he was smaller than Rogers was, right?

00:13:11.357 --> 00:13:13.993
Nobody's got that flag in 17 years!

00:13:22.635 --> 00:13:25.871
Yo, the smallest guy in the formation

00:13:25.871 --> 00:13:28.574
wound up coming up with
the plan of success.

00:13:28.574 --> 00:13:30.643
In the basic-training environment,

00:13:30.643 --> 00:13:34.113
you probably wouldn't have
that type of situation

00:13:34.113 --> 00:13:36.682
placed on a trainee or a recruit.

00:13:36.682 --> 00:13:40.152
That's some
special-missions-type unit stuff

00:13:40.152 --> 00:13:42.188
that's going on there where

00:13:42.188 --> 00:13:43.956
an assessment is being done, right?

00:13:43.956 --> 00:13:46.592
Because they want to know if
