00:13:46.592 --> 00:13:49.261
What they were actually
doing in the training

00:13:49.261 --> 00:13:50.963
would not necessarily be something

00:13:50.963 --> 00:13:52.498
that you would see in recruit training.

00:13:52.498 --> 00:13:53.899
So I'm going to give it a five.

00:13:53.899 --> 00:13:56.368
Left! Face!

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.805
Yeah, that's the campaign hat

