00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:03.675
who might take something personal

00:19:03.675 --> 00:19:05.110
like it looks like in this clip.

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:07.980
Because of the flexibility and the things

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:11.383
that take place in the
Officer Candidate School

00:19:11.383 --> 00:19:13.852
versus what happens in recruit training

00:19:13.852 --> 00:19:15.387
for initial entry training,

00:19:15.387 --> 00:19:18.991
I would say that it's
probably about a seven.

00:19:19.958 --> 00:19:22.094
All right, Shirley, you can drop them now.

00:19:23.996 --> 00:19:26.031
Weight training has always been something

00:19:26.031 --> 00:19:27.399
that's important in the military

00:19:27.399 --> 00:19:29.268
