00:19:43.649 --> 00:19:45.317
Drill instructor: See the jab? Outside?

00:19:45.317 --> 00:19:47.252
Right into the body once again.

00:19:47.252 --> 00:19:48.520
Working with the blade.

00:19:52.224 --> 00:19:54.760
They were doing combatives,
